repository-code: "https://github.com/Homeew/magnetic-dipole-simulator"
url: "https://homeew.github.io/magnetic-dipole-simulator/"
abstract: >
  A standalone C++ simulation of magnetic dipole fields with configurable
  sensor array modeling (ring, grid, sphere) and nonlinear least-squares
  parameter estimation via Levenberg-Marquardt optimisation. Implements
  the core estimation pipeline underlying published research on magnetic
  localization for wireless capsule endoscopy.
keywords:
  - magnetic dipole
  - Levenberg-Marquardt
  - localization
  - wireless capsule endoscopy
  - C++
  - pybind11
